  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx + (1)/(x) = - 13\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na² + b² = (a + b)² - 2ab\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx² + (1)/(x²) = (x + (1)/(x))² - 2 × x × (1)/(x)\n\n⇒ x² + (1)/(x²) = 13² - 2\n\n⇒ x2 + (1)/(x²) = 167\n\nNow,\n\nx⁴ + (1)/(x⁴) = (x2 + (1)/(x²))² - 2\n\n⇒ (167)² -2\n\n⇒ 27889 - 2 = 27887\n\n⇒ x⁴ + (1)/(x⁴) = 27887\n\n∴ **The value of x4 + (1)/(x⁴)**** =** 27887**.**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] **__Shortcut Trick__**If x + (1)/(x) = p,\n\nthen x2 + (1)/(x²) = p² - 2\n\n⇒ x + (1)/(x) = - 13\n\n⇒ x2 + (1)/(x²) = (-13)2 - 2 = 167 = k(Let)\n\nIf x2 + (1)/(x²) = k, \n\nthen x⁴ + (1)/(x⁴) = k² - 2\n\n⇒ x2 + (1)/(x²) = 167\n\n⇒ x4 + (1)/(x⁴) = (167)2 - 2 \n\n⇒ 27887",
